; Save the parsed record for the player's reply
;
; Stores A in AwaitingAnswer ($B71A) and copies the 24-byte parsed record at IY to
; $B9C8, the top record of the phrase stack. #R$7960 tests AwaitingAnswer first and
; when it is not 0 goes on with the reply; the callers pass the offset of the
; noun phrase (RecWork6/7) the question is about ("Which ...?", "... what?").
;
; A Offset of the noun phrase being asked about, from RecWork6/7
; IY Parsed phrase record to keep
@label=SaveParsedRecord
c$7D74 LD ($B71A),A  ;
 $7D77 PUSH IY       ;
 $7D79 POP HL        ;
 $7D7A LD DE,$B9C8        ; top of the phrase stack
@isub=LD BC,PARSED_RECORD_SIZE
 $7D7D LD BC,$0018   ;
 $7D80 LDIR          ;
 $7D82 RET           ;
